Having bad stats recently with ascending males I managed to ascend one
today; viva emancipation! And it has been somewhat different this game.

Haven't found any genocide scrolls and thus unintentionally made it
genoless. Haven't found any charging scrolls and used one single wish
for some scrolls, AFAIR, to recharge at least the wand of wishing (0:1);
thus not wishless. Haven't found a ring of levitation and didn't want
to change armor on the plane of air, so I decided to bless a stack of
potions of levitation to hover across air and fire level; works fine
with speed boots still worn. Fire was a pain due to an Archon that did
not stop summoning hard hitting beasts. And the portal was at the far
end of the map. I zapped and broke quite some wands of teleportation.
At astral I decided to first face Pestilence, and when he approached
faster than I've expected and suddenly stood adjacent I got nervous.
But with my enchanted stack of daggers he fell quite fast without even
infecting me once. And luckily the first altar was the right one.

Inspecting my stats log I noticed that I was lacking disintegration
resistance! 8-o  Maybe a summoned gremlin at fire level took it from
me. Glad that this dark dragon did not hit me. That could have been
one of these frustrating games where you think you made it and wonder
why you died. (This time not :-)

